{"id": "x001-001", "text": "Coffee with Valentina. Her dad passed away last Tuesday and the funeral is on November 4. She seemed numb more than anything. Her brother is flying in from Canada and she's sorting most of it herself because her mum can't face it. She asked if I'd do a reading. I said yes, obviously, but I've never done one before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Valentina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "November 4", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "numb", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "brother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying in from Canada", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't face it", "owner": "r3", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "x001-002", "text": "Jada and Florin are hosting a housewarming sometime next week. I'm bringing the dessert.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jada", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Florin", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "housewarming", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "x001-003", "text": "Noah got made redundant from the logistics firm on Friday. He's putting a brave face on it but I think he's pretty shaken. His wife Ciara is pregnant with their second, due in early March, which makes the timing awful. He's going to try contracting for a while. Remind me to call him early next week and send him that recruiter's details.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant from the logistics firm", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "putting a brave face on it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "pretty shaken", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ciara", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pregnant", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in early March", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "try contracting", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "early next week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him that recruiter's details", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "x001-004", "text": "Hannah is flying to Tokyo on March 3rd for two weeks. Her first long-haul flight on her own and she's slightly terrified.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hannah", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying to Tokyo", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "March 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "two weeks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "slightly terrified", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
