{"id": "x001-007", "text": "Julia and Oliver broke up. Apparently it happened over the summer and she only told people now. She's doing fine, she says, and has thrown herself into bouldering.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oliver", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "broke up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "now"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "bouldering", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "x001-008", "text": "Need to buy a card and some flowers for Vera before her mum's funeral on Thursday.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "buy a card and some flowers for Vera", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Vera", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "x001-009", "text": "Imogen invited us to her 40th at the end of the month. It's a garden party at her parents' place in Kent. She said absolutely no presents, but she did mention she's been wanting a decent pasta machine. Her husband Jack is organising a surprise slideshow and wants old photos by the 20th.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Imogen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "40th", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "absolutely no presents", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wanting a decent pasta machine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surprise slideshow", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the 20th", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "x001-010", "text": "Ravi is off to Portugal early March with his girlfriend. They've booked a villa near Lagos.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ravi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to Portugal", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p1"}]}
