{"id": "x001-034", "text": "Noah's dog Bruno went missing yesterday. They found him this morning two streets away, thank god. Noah is relieved.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Bruno", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "went missing", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "relieved", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "x001-035", "text": "Dinner at Oliver's on Saturday. He's doing his famous lamb. I'm in charge of wine.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oliver", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
