{"id": "x001-043", "text": "Kalani starts a new job in Honolulu in June, so they are moving back sometime over the summer. Alana is excited but sad to leave her friends here. We need to do a proper goodbye dinner for them before they go, maybe the last weekend of May.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kalani", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job in Honolulu", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in June", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving back", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime over the summer", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "excited", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sad to leave her friends", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "do a proper goodbye dinner for them", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "before they go", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the last weekend of May", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "x001-044", "text": "Julia went to the Amalfi Coast last week. Must ask her how it was.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "went to the Amalfi Coast", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her how it was", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "x001-045", "text": "Björn and his wife have just split after twenty years. He's taking it very hard. Text him this weekend, and maybe invite him to the barbecue on July 4th. Their daughter Ava is starting uni in September, so he's dreading the house being empty. He said he might go walking in Norway over the summer to clear his head.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Björn", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "split", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "taking it very hard", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "invite him to the barbecue", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "barbecue", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "July 4th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ava", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "uni", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading the house being empty", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "walking in Norway", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e4"}]}
{"id": "x001-046", "text": "Zainab's sister Amira graduates from Edinburgh on June 28th. The whole family is going.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zainab", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amira", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduates from Edinburgh", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 28th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "x001-047", "text": "Caitlin mentioned she has a fear of flying, so the trip to New York in late October is a big deal for her. Wish her luck before she goes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caitlin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fear of flying", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "trip to New York", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in late October", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Wish her luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "before she goes", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "x001-048", "text": "Camila Santos at the gym has just been made redundant from the bank. She seemed upbeat though, says she's going to travel around South America for a few months over the winter.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Camila Santos", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant from the bank", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "upbeat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "travel around South America", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a few months", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the winter", "anchor": "e2"}]}
